  {
    "id": 3,
    "name": "Mina: Someone Above",
    "description": "Wake greeting (~9 s): the coffin creaks, the rose kindles, and Mina whispers up to the guest, inviting them to tell her about the sky. The rose stays lit for the conversation.",
